Value Filldown LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID_TYPE (.+?)
Value Required CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID_TYPE (.+?)
Value PORT_ID (.+?)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (.*?)
Value List SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION (.*?)
Value List MGMT_ADDRESS (\S+)

# One record per LLDP neighbour under its local port header (eNSP Pro AR6700, USG6306F
# and CE6800, YunShan OS 1.25.1.1). A neighbour starts at its index line. The system
# description goes on over unindented lines until a blank one. Other "key :value" lines
# are not modeled.
Start
  ^\d{4}-\d\d-\d\d \d\d:\d\d:\d\d(?:\.\d+)?\s*$$
  ^\S+ has \d+ neighbor -> Continue.Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE} has \d+ neighbor\(s\):?\s*$$
  ^Neighbor index\s*: -> Continue.Record
  ^Neighbor index\s*:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^Chassis type\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^Chassis ID\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_ID}\s*$$
  ^Port ID subtype\s*:\s*${PORT_ID_TYPE}\s*$$
  ^Port ID\s*:\s*${PORT_ID}\s*$$
  ^System name\s*:\s*${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$
  ^System description\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Description
  ^Management address\s*:\s*${MGMT_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^[A-Za-z][\w ()/.,-]*?\s*:.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display lldp neighbor line"

Description
  ^\s*$$ -> Start
  ^${SYSTEM_DESCRIPTION}\s*$$
